ALGORITH : SMART CART
1. START
2.READ THE PURCHASE AMOUNT,CUSTOMER TYPE,DELIVERY DISTANCE
3.CALCULATE THE DISCOUNT BASED ON THE PURCHASE AMOUNT AND CUSTOMER TYPE
4.SUBTRACT THE DISCOUNT FROM THR PURCHASE AMOUNT TO GET THE DISCOUNTED AMOUNT
5.CALCULATE THE DELIVERY CHARGE BASED ON THE DELIVERY DISTANCE
6.ADD THE DELIVERY CHARGE TO THE DISCOUNTED AMOUNT TO CALCULATE THE FINAL PAYABLE AMOUNT
7.DISPLAY THE PURCHASE AMOUNT,DISCOUNT,DELIVERY CHARGE AND FINAL PAYABLE AMOUNT
8.STOP
